# Supabase configuration for the Abdullah & Esraa wedding invitation
# (artifacts/wedding-invite). The guestbook / wishes list is backed by
# Supabase Postgres + Row Level Security — this is the single source of
# truth for guest wishes (no Firebase, no localStorage).
#
# These are OPTIONAL for local development, but without them the guestbook
# shows a developer-friendly configuration notice instead of the form.
#
# To enable the wishes backend:
# 1. Create a project at https://supabase.com
# 2. In SQL Editor, create the "wishes" table and RLS policies
#    (see the SQL provided with the project docs)
# 3. Copy the project URL and the anon/public key from
#    Project Settings -> API
# 4. Set them as environment variables (prefixed with VITE_ so Vite exposes
#    them to the frontend build)

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
